      "id": "rung_main_908d3e55-88e2-4bf0-8bdd-152c23beb273",
      "comment": "Mould toggle 3/3: Man_Mould_Closed := Mode_Manual AND ((Load_Mould AND Mould_Closed) OR (NOT Load_Mould AND (Man_Mould_Closed XOR Mould_Click))). The XOR is written as two branches: kept without a click, flipped by a click. Outside Manual the latch is FALSE. The jog watchdog does not touch it",
